     "alt": ""
    }
   ],
   "html": "<p>A curated group of VIP guests and lucky fans joined us for an exclusive drive-in themed block party to celebrate a new era of Kali Uchis. Kali hosted her closest friends, VIP guests and lucky fans for the premiere of her “Sunshine &amp; Rain” music video to celebrate the forthcoming album <em>Sincerely</em>. Curated market vendors, themed photo moments, branded merch and live DJs rounded out the memorable evening.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "THE VINTAGE DRIVE-IN",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Classic vintage cars and lowriders were strategically placed around a built screen and platform to emulate a traditional drive in theater. Guests could pose for pictures with the cars while the car owners proudly show them and their trick capabilities off.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
