  },
  {
   "title": "MUSIC VIDEO PREMIERE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>For the main event of the evening, Kali made a special appearance to introduce the world premiere of her music video for “Sunshine &amp; Rain.”</p>"
