    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "NIGHT MARKET",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Midcity Mercado brought in a curated group of 25 Black and Brown entrepreneurs, creatives and vendors for guests to enjoy and shop from. The footprint of beauty, home goods, clothing and more was complete with papel picado and string lights.</p>"
    },
