  {
   "title": "ADDITIONAL ACTIVITIES",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Exclusive merch was displayed and sold out of the trunks of two vintage lowriders, creating a unique and immersive experience. Guests got first access to limited-edition <em>Sincerely</em>-themed merchandise, including three T-shirts, a hat, and a tote bag. A nostalgic “Lover’s Lookout” photo moment sponsored by Meta offered a picturesque backdrop where guests could pose in front of a vintage car. As the evening unfolded, guests danced to timeless oldies and Kali Uchis classics. DJs <strong>Anthony Gabriel Flores</strong>, <strong>Jadaboo</strong>, and <strong>Von Kiss</strong> of <strong>Scam and Jam</strong> kept the energy high with live sets and introduced Kali ahead of the music video premiere.</p>"
    },
